# r1115 phase 2 boot 2: restart of the p2_r1 server (same OUT, level p2pwg), jar -18. SQ-PWG-54r (BX = 1380: -54 ran
# shifted as in r1114). The "read before" of the row is the last `contraptions all` of SQ-PWG-54 in p2_r1 (then stop).
pace 1

## SQ-PWG-54r | solar contraption after a restart: re-attaches on its first tick in a forceloaded chunk
bootexpect Done \(
> forceload add 1380 1500 1395 1515
> time set 6000
> weather clear
sleep 5
> forceload query
> zpwg6 contraptions all 1380 -60 1510
waitlog \[zpwg6\] (bearing|done) 20
sleep 1
> zpwg6 solar 1380 -60 1510
sleep 1
expect \[zpwg6\] controlled id=\d+ .*removed=false.*type=powergrid:solar_panel blocks=2 .*controller=\S+ attachedToBearing=true
expect \[zpwg6\] bearing at 1380 -60 1510 movedContraption=set
expect \[zpwg6\] solar powergrid:solar_panel_bearing
reject \[zpwg\w*\] error
reject ^(?!.*RuntimeDistCleaner).*(Exception|/ERROR\]).*(powergrid|patryk)
look solar output non-zero at noon; one controlled entity; record controller= (p2_r1b before the restart: controller=none with attachedToBearing=true)
